 things off for the first hour & 28 minutes of exclusive material ranging from Mr. Carmack, Kaytranada, Sango, Jo Def, Esta, and many others. Great Dane truly understands our memo when we say, 'NO TIME FOR FILLER TRACKS'. As soon as he hit play constant energy and bass started flowing. He played an exclusive 45 minute set which consisted of all original productions except for two tracks. This won't be the last time you hear from him.\n \n\n\n\n Thanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"UYFL4YOlisI","position":41,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"CAZEAUX OSLO - That's the Sound","track":{"id":"Y90Fcj-H9Fc","path":"/artists/cazeaux-oslo/tracks/that-s-the-sound/","slug":"thats-the-sound","title":"That's the Sound","artist":{"slug":"cazeaux-oslo","title":"CAZEAUX OSLO"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"s9V9Fge9BTw","slug":"291","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-291/ra.1191631113","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-291"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #291","artwork":"/images/episodes/291.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7160,"location":"US","published_at":"2017-01-07T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"nvsNgv_90MI","position":36,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"CAZEAUX OSLO - Strength of the sun","track":{"id":"NwE8iERmDs8","path":"/artists/cazeaux-oslo/tracks/strength-of-the-sun/","slug":"strength-of-the-sun","title":"Strength of the sun","artist":{"slug":"cazeaux-oslo","title":"CAZEAUX OSLO"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Jg9Pdh4kvPA","slug":"317","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-317/ra.1257333689","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/sou